   "x": 80,
   "y": 930,
   "width": 352.8,
   "height": 67.5,
   "text": "Where your message is ambiguous the\nexperts choose as an expert would,\nand tell you what they chose.",
   "originalText": "Where your message is ambiguous the\nexperts choose as an expert would,\nand tell you what they chose.",
