  {
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1720,
   "y": 930,
   "width": 493.9200000000001,
   "height": 135.0,
   "text": "Sources with their dates, findings with quotes,\nand what they settled. The experts apply it, so a\nrun needs no web access. It settled two choices:\n  - the prompt does not open with an expert role\n  - the experts are subagents, not teammates\nSay \"redo the research\" to refresh it.",
   "originalText": "Sources with their dates, findings with quotes,\nand what they settled. The experts apply it, so a\nrun needs no web access. It settled two choices:\n  - the prompt does not open with an expert role\n  - the experts are subagents, not teammates\nSay \"redo the research\" to refresh it.",
